<title>UK: Redrow to join FTSE250 after Calor acquired.</title>
<headline>Redrow to join FTSE250 after Calor acquired.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British share market indices operator FTSE International said on Thursday that its actuaries committee had decided building company Redrow Group Plc would replace Calor Group plc in the FTSE 250 index from the close of business today.</p>
<p>The move follows Calor's acquisition by SHV Energy Holdings.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
